{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794564303473,"sessionID":"ses_e2ba468f8ffe2Nj9hM9jYXmEDS","part":{"partID":"prt_1d45e238a001ZTA3krVV1Nhds0","sessionID":"ses_e2ba468f8ffe2Nj9hM9jYXmEDS","messageID":"msg_1d45e12840013tKPgmpDcP7Ky7","type":"tool","id":"call_d7688879e3464d538a4a98cb","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md","oldString":"The hook writes records only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics.","newString":"The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics."},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n@@ -38,9 +38,9 @@\n ### Diagnostics\n \n Hook diagnostics are prompt-safe rollups handled by `lib/metrics.ts`. The `spec_kit.<group>.<metric_name>` instrumentation namespace emits only when `SPECKIT_METRICS_ENABLED=true`. Default off is no emission and is byte-identical to the pre-instrumentation surface. Alert thresholds for the rolling cache-hit p95 are read from the environment with conservative defaults: `SPECKIT_ADVISOR_HOOK_CACHE_HIT_P95_WARN_MS` (default 75) and `SPECKIT_ADVISOR_HOOK_CACHE_HIT_P95_PAGE_MS` (default 150). Both flags are forwarded to the daemon child through the launcher `CHILD_ENV_ALLOWLIST` so the same thresholds reach every runtime.\n \n-Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes records only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n+Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n \n ---\n \n ## 3. SOURCE FILES\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\",\"oldString\":\"The hook writes records only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics.\",\"newString\":\"The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794564301706,"end":1794564303473}}}}
